{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22533","headline":"和谈校书秋夜感怀呈朝中亲友 · 白居易","name":"和谈校书秋夜感怀呈朝中亲友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遥夜凉风楚客悲，清砧繁漏月高时。\n秋霜似鬓年空长，春草如袍位尚卑。\n词赋擅名来已久，烟霄得路去何迟。\n汉庭卿相皆知己，不荐扬雄欲荐谁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22533.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22533","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}